{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Pinhead Adventures is the first game from Neversold Studios. ver. 0.5.X<br>Swing, blast, and grapple your way around in Pinhead Adventures!<br>Answering a distress beacon coming from a ancient PASA probe,\u00a0<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2882840/extras/Pinhead-AdventureAbout-Section-Banner.png?t=1744133329\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Zortan shows up behind Pinhead and Orbo!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">When they least expect it, he blasts them out of space!<br>Narrowly surviving, crashing on one of 3 worlds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2882840/extras/Estoria_About_Section_Banner.png?t=1744133329\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Estoria, an old communication relay powered by 3 massive towers. <br>Climb the towers and power the relay to signal for Zortan's return.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Power up with Statues that improve Health, Action Points, and +1ups!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2882840/extras/Lil_Green_About_Section_Banner.png?t=1744133329\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Lil Green, a long abandoned Pinhead home world. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Infested with Zortan's minion's. All spawning from Nests, always proving a fight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Spiker, Spitter, Spod, and Swooper. Stabbing, spitting, and swooping as evilly intended.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2882840/extras/About_Section_Banner_Big_Purp.png?t=1744133329\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Big Purp, smashing into the forest below the Facility. A book of prophecy waits for discovery.<br>Find the pages to tell the story. It tells a story that sometimes can't be won. Permadeath.<br>In your death you'll find a new timeline. One that will change the game.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2882840/extras/Pinhead-AdventureAbout-Section-Banner.png?t=1744133329\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Customize your Pinhead and conquer the end of time in style! 35 Curated Collectable Customization options available for you to find! Don't loose your hat!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Final Update Coming soon...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Current Major Patch 0.5.X </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Join us in this Pinhead Adventure! Play Today!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2882840?t=1744133329","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2882840/1d27026ef81b95ba28f9b2d10742283f2979746d/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1744133329","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2882840/a53bb8039053da1d11a69826fe197294765b4537/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744133329","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2882840/a53bb8039053da1d11a69826fe197294765b4537/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744133329","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3578680,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Pinhead Adventures is the first game from Neversold Studios. ver. 0.5.X<br>Swing, blast, and grapple your way around in Pinhead Adventures!<br>Answering a distress beacon coming from a ancient PASA probe,\u00a0<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2882840/extras/Pinhead-AdventureAbout-Section-Banner.png?t=1744133329\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Zortan shows up behind Pinhead and Orbo!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">When they least expect it, he blasts them out of space!<br>Narrowly surviving, crashing on one of 3 worlds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2882840/extras/Estoria_About_Section_Banner.png?t=1744133329\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Estoria, an old communication relay powered by 3 massive towers. <br>Climb the towers and power the relay to signal for Zortan's return.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Power up with Statues that improve Health, Action Points, and +1ups!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2882840/extras/Lil_Green_About_Section_Banner.png?t=1744133329\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Lil Green, a long abandoned Pinhead home world. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Infested with Zortan's minion's. All spawning from Nests, always proving a fight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Spiker, Spitter, Spod, and Swooper. Stabbing, spitting, and swooping as evilly intended.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2882840/extras/About_Section_Banner_Big_Purp.png?t=1744133329\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Big Purp, smashing into the forest below the Facility. A book of prophecy waits for discovery.<br>Find the pages to tell the story. It tells a story that sometimes can't be won. Permadeath.<br>In your death you'll find a new timeline. One that will change the game.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2882840/extras/Pinhead-AdventureAbout-Section-Banner.png?t=1744133329\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Customize your Pinhead and conquer the end of time in style! 35 Curated Collectable Customization options available for you to find! Don't loose your hat!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Final Update Coming soon...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Current Major Patch 0.5.X </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Join us in this Pinhead Adventure! Play Today!</p>","developers":["Neversold"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2882840/b7aee5718775c15d3ecab7fa1e1f64d1c7f94966/header.jpg?t=1744133329","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257114237,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257114237/movie480.mp4?t=1741910451","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257114237/movie_max.mp4?t=1741910451"},"name":"The Zino Early Access Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257114237/cf87d0a648ed06baa6192a708caef48607d310cb/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1741910451","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257114237/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1741910451","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257114237/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1741910451"}},{"highlight":false,"id":257083977,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257083977/movie480.mp4?t=1734747808","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257083977/movie_max.mp4?t=1734747808"},"name":"Revamped Early Access Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257083977/e3f9d1fe16d6da15079aecb5a595332cb6e7cee4/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1734747808","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257083977/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1734747808","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2570839